  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Riftbound.QuestGiver
  npcName: Abe
  questTitle: The Forest Road
  introduction: 'These old bones cannot patrol the road anymore, but our supplies still need to get through. Raiders have been gathering beyond the village gate.


    Clear them out, and I will see that you are paid.'
  progress: The road is still dangerous. Keep your eyes open beyond the gate, and return when you have dealt with three raiders.
  completion: "You did it! The merchants can travel safely again. A small purse, as promised \u2014 and the thanks of this old man."
  rewardGold: 25
